index 0000000..22a363d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added ``min`` and ``max`` thresholds to the ``diskusage`` beacon, allowing an alert to fire when a mount's usage drops to or below a configured minimum (e.g. to catch a filesystem that silently failed to mount) in addition to the existing high-usage alerting.
diff --git a/salt/beacons/diskusage.py b/salt/beacons/diskusage.py
